# NetGuard-AI
## Smart Network Failure Prediction System

NetGuard-AI is an AI-powered system designed to monitor network performance and predict potential network failures before they occur.

## Project Goal

The system analyzes network metrics such as latency, packet loss, bandwidth, CPU usage, and memory usage to identify abnormal behavior and predict possible network failures.

## Technologies

- Python
- Pandas
- Scikit-learn
- PostgreSQL
- FastAPI
- Streamlit
